      "OR1 is an inclusive (OR) join with inputs ['XOR2', 'AND1']. PM4Py translates an OR join like an AND join (it waits for a token on every input) and adds skip transitions only between an OR split and an OR join; this model has no OR split, so OR1 blocks every case that does not deliver a token on all of its inputs.",
